    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LWK are deligthed to present 4A Camac Park, Inchicore, Dublin 12 to the market.\r\n\r\n4A Camac Park is an attractive three-bedroom, two-bathroom detached dormer bungalow, ideally positioned within this established residential area of Dublin 12. The property offers bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, complemented by a mature south-west facing rear garden and the added benefit of off-street parking to the front.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are welcomed by a warm and inviting entrance hallway which leads to a spacious front-facing living room. This elegant reception room is enhanced by a feature fireplace, stylish herringbone flooring and an attractive bay window, which allows for an abundance of natural light and creates a bright and comfortable space for relaxing and entertaining. To the rear of the property is a fully fitted kitchen overlooking the mature south-west facing garden. A separate dining room provides an excellent space for family dining and entertaining, while a separate utility room offers valuable additional storage and practicality. Both the dining room and utility room benefit from direct access to the rear garden. The ground floor accommodation is further enhanced by a large double bedroom with the benefit of an ensuite bathroom, offering excellent flexibility for family living, guests or those seeking the convenience of ground-floor accommodation. Upstairs, there are two further large double bedrooms, both providing generous and comfortable accommodation, together with a family bathroom completing the first-floor layout.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property is further complemented by a mature south-west facing rear garden, providing an excellent private outdoor space in which to relax and enjoy the afternoon and evening sunshine. Off-street parking to the front completes this appealing home.\r\n\r\nCamac Park enjoys a convenient location in Dublin 12, close to a wide range of local amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday services. The surrounding area is well served by a choice of primary and secondary schools, sporting and recreational facilities, making it an attractive location for families. Nearby areas including Crumlin, Kimmage, Walkinstown and Terenure provide an excellent selection of additional amenities and services.\r\nThe property also benefits from excellent transport links, with regular bus services providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and surrounding areas. The location offers easy access to the M50 and the wider road network, while the city centre and many of Dublin's employment hubs are within easy reach.\r\n4A Camac Park represents a wonderful opportunity to acquire a distinctive detached family home offering spacious and versatile accommodation, a mature south-west facing garden and off-street parking, all within a highly convenient Dublin 12 location. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this superb home has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
